cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "STATE paper: code and results for A Systems Theory of Cardiac-Autonomic Trajectories and Equilibria"
abstract: >-
  Code, exact calculations, simulations and manuscript sources for STATE, a systems
  theory in which cardiac autonomic regulation is a latent stochastic dynamical system
  observed through RR intervals. Every number in the manuscript is regenerated from this repository.
